> Worked around for Tailwind and PostCSS by forcing CJS in the `type: module` project with `.cjs` file extension for `postcss.config.cjs` and `tailwind.config.cjs`.

@ctjlewis  I'm not sure this works? At least from what I can tell from the way `findConfig` searches for files. For me, the `.cjs` versions get ignored. [See also here](https://twitter.com/adamwathan/status/1504465711120408578).

@BB-19 I'm not sure this can work for  filtering plugins against `process.env.NODE_ENV` such as [written about here](https://nextjs.org/docs/advanced-features/customizing-postcss-config#customizing-plugins=)
